    <Description>Dark Godhuman Venom Bow Combo

A fast and deadly combo built around Dark, Godhuman, Venom and Soul Guitar. This combo focuses on chaining abilities with precise timing to keep the opponent locked and deal heavy damage.

Combo:
Dark C, Venom Bow X, Z, Godhuman Z, C, X

Requires good timing and positioning for consistent execution.
</Description>
